#: ../../api-reference.md:3
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Ìtọ́kasí API"

#: ../../api-reference.md:5
msgid ""
"This page is generated from the OpenAPI file, which is exported from the "
"service code. When the API changes, this page changes with it."
msgstr ""
"Ojú-ìwé yìí jẹ́ dídá láti inú fáìlì OpenAPI, tí a ń yọ jáde láti inú kóòdù "
"iṣẹ́. Nígbà tí API bá yí padà, ojú-ìwé yìí náà yóò yí padà pẹ̀lú rẹ̀."

#: ../../api-reference.md:7
msgid ""
"All endpoints except `/health` need an API key. See "
"[Authentication](authentication.md)."
msgstr ""
"Gbogbo endpoints yàtọ̀ sí `/health` nílò API key. Wo "
"[Ìfàṣẹsí](authentication.md)."

#: ../../api-reference.md:9
msgid "POST /v1/generate"
msgstr "POST /v1/generate"

#: ../../api-reference.md:11
msgid "**Generate text**"
msgstr "**Ṣẹ̀dá ọ̀rọ̀**"

#: ../../api-reference.md:13
msgid ""
"Sends a prompt to a model and returns the response. The response includes"
" an X-Data-Region header that echoes the region that processed the "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Ó ń fi prompt ránṣẹ́ sí model, ó sì ń dá ìdáhùn padà. Ìdáhùn náà ní "
"X-Data-Region header tí ó ń fi agbègbè tí ó ṣe ìbéèrè náà hàn."

#: ../../api-reference.md:15 ../../api-reference.md:74
#: ../../api-reference.md:104
msgid "Requires an API key."
msgstr "Ó nílò API key."

#: ../../api-reference.md:17 ../../api-reference.md:106
msgid "Request body"
msgstr "Ara ìbéèrè"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Ààyè"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Irú"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Ó pọndandan"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Àlàyé"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`model`"
msgstr "`model`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "string"
msgstr "string"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Bẹ́ẹ̀ni"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "ID of the model to use. List them with GET /v1/models."
msgstr "ID ti model tí a fẹ́ lò. Ṣàkójọ wọn pẹ̀lú GET /v1/models."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`prompt`"
msgstr "`prompt`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The text you want the model to respond to. Length 1 to 4000 characters."
msgstr ""
"Ọ̀rọ̀ tí o fẹ́ kí model dáhùn sí. Gígùn rẹ̀ jẹ́ láàárín ohun kikọ 1 sí 4000."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`language`"
msgstr "`language`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "Rárá"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Language code of the prompt. Each model supports a different set. "
"Default: `\"en\"`."
msgstr ""
"Kóòdù èdè prompt. Model kọ̀ọ̀kan ní àwọn èdè tí ó yàtọ̀ tí ó ń ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn. "
"Aiyipada: `\"en\"`."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`max_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "integer"
msgstr "integer"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Upper limit on tokens in the response. Cannot exceed the model's "
"max_output_tokens. Default: `64`. Minimum 1."
msgstr ""
"Iye tó pọ̀ jù lọ ti tokens nínú ìdáhùn. Kò lè kọjá "
"`max_output_tokens` ti model náà. Aiyipada: `64`. Kéré jù: 1."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`region`"
msgstr "`region`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Where the request is processed: ke, ug, ma or mu. Default: `\"ke\"`."
msgstr ""
"Agbègbè tí a ti ń ṣe ìbéèrè náà: ke, ug, ma tàbí mu. Aiyipada: `\"ke\"`."

#: ../../api-reference.md:27 ../../api-reference.md:112
msgid "Example request body:"
msgstr "Àpẹẹrẹ ara ìbéèrè:"

#: ../../api-reference.md:39 ../../api-reference.md:76
#: ../../api-reference.md:120 ../../api-reference.md:145
msgid "Responses"
msgstr "Àwọn ìdáhùn"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Ipò"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Ìtumọ̀"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "200"
msgstr "200"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The generated text and token usage."
msgstr "Ọ̀rọ̀ tí a ṣẹ̀dá àti lílo tokens."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "400"
msgstr "400"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The request was invalid. Check the message field."
msgstr "Ìbéèrè náà kò bófin mu. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ààyè message."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "401"
msgstr "401"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The API key is missing or not valid."
msgstr "API key kò sí tàbí kò bófin mu."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "404"
msgstr "404"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The model or endpoint does not exist."
msgstr "Model tàbí endpoint náà kò sí."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "429"
msgstr "429"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Rate limit exceeded. Wait for the number of seconds in the Retry-After "
"header."
msgstr ""
"A ti kọjá ààlà iye àwọn ìbéèrè. Dúró fún iye ìṣẹ́jú-aaya tí ó wà nínú "
"Retry-After header."

#: ../../api-reference.md:49 ../../api-reference.md:84
#: ../../api-reference.md:129 ../../api-reference.md:151
msgid "A `200` response has these fields."
msgstr "Ìdáhùn `200` ní àwọn ààyè wọ̀nyí."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`id`"
msgstr "`id`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Unique ID for this generation."
msgstr "ID aláìlẹ́gbẹ́ fún ìṣẹ̀dá yìí."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The model that handled the request."
msgstr "Model tí ó bójú tó ìbéèrè náà."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The language code you sent."
msgstr "Kóòdù èdè tí o ránṣẹ́."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`output`"
msgstr "`output`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The generated text."
msgstr "Ọ̀rọ̀ tí a ṣẹ̀dá."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`finish_reason`"
msgstr "`finish_reason`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "string, one of `stop`, `length`"
msgstr "string, ọ̀kan lára `stop`, `length`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"stop means the response ended naturally. length means it was cut off at "
"max_tokens."
msgstr ""
"`stop` túmọ̀ sí pé ìdáhùn náà parí lọ́nà àdáni. `length` túmọ̀ sí pé a "
"gé e kúrò ní `max_tokens`."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`usage`"
msgstr "`usage`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Usage object"
msgstr "Ohun usage"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Token counts for this request."
msgstr "Iye tokens fún ìbéèrè yìí."

#: ../../api-reference.md:60
msgid "The `usage` object has these fields."
msgstr "Ohun `usage` ní àwọn ààyè wọ̀nyí."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`prompt_tokens`"
msgstr "`prompt_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Tokens in the prompt."
msgstr "Tokens nínú prompt."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`completion_tokens`"
msgstr "`completion_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Tokens in the response."
msgstr "Tokens nínú ìdáhùn."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`total_tokens`"
msgstr "`total_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "prompt_tokens plus completion_tokens."
msgstr "`prompt_tokens` àti `completion_tokens` papọ̀."

#: ../../api-reference.md:68 ../../api-reference.md:98
#: ../../api-reference.md:137
msgid "Failures use the standard error body described in [Errors](errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Àwọn ìkùnà máa ń lo ara aṣìṣe boṣewa tí a ṣàlàyé nínú "
"[Àwọn Aṣìṣe](errors.md)."

#: ../../api-reference.md:70
msgid "GET /v1/models"
msgstr "GET /v1/models"

#: ../../api-reference.md:72
msgid "**List models**"
msgstr "**Ṣàkójọ àwọn model**"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The models you can use."
msgstr "Àwọn model tí o lè lò."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`data`"
msgstr "`data`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "array of ModelInfo object"
msgstr "array àwọn ohun ModelInfo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The available models."
msgstr "Àwọn model tí ó wà."

#: ../../api-reference.md:90
msgid "Each item in `data` has these fields."
msgstr "Ohun kọ̀ọ̀kan nínú `data` ní àwọn ààyè wọ̀nyí."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Model ID. Pass this as model when you generate text."
msgstr "ID Model. Fún un gẹ́gẹ́ bí `model` nígbà tí o bá ń ṣẹ̀dá ọ̀rọ̀."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`max_output_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_output_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Largest max_tokens value this model accepts."
msgstr "Iye `max_tokens` tó pọ̀ jù tí model yìí lè gba."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`languages`"
msgstr "`languages`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "array of string"
msgstr "array àwọn string"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Language codes this model accepts."
msgstr "Àwọn kóòdù èdè tí model yìí ń gba."

#: ../../api-reference.md:100
msgid "POST /v1/tokens/count"
msgstr "POST /v1/tokens/count"

#: ../../api-reference.md:102
msgid "**Count tokens**"
msgstr "**Kà àwọn tokens**"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`text`"
msgstr "`text`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Text to count tokens for. Length 1 to 20000 characters."
msgstr "Ọ̀rọ̀ tí a fẹ́ kà tokens rẹ̀. Gígùn rẹ̀ jẹ́ láàárín ohun kikọ 1 sí 20000."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The token count for the text."
msgstr "Iye tokens fún ọ̀rọ̀ náà."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`token_count`"
msgstr "`token_count`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Number of tokens in the text."
msgstr "Iye tokens nínú ọ̀rọ̀ náà."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`word_count`"
msgstr "`word_count`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Number of words in the text, split on whitespace."
msgstr "Iye àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ nínú ọ̀rọ̀ náà, tí a pín sílẹ̀ níbi ààyè."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`tokens_per_word`"
msgstr "`tokens_per_word`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "number"
msgstr "number"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "token_count divided by word_count, rounded to two decimals."
msgstr "`token_count` pín pẹ̀lú `word_count`, tí a yí padà sí decimal méjì."

#: ../../api-reference.md:139
msgid "GET /health"
msgstr "GET /health"

#: ../../api-reference.md:141
msgid "**Check service health**"
msgstr "**Ṣàyẹ̀wò ìlera iṣẹ́**"

#: ../../api-reference.md:143
msgid "No API key needed."
msgstr "A kò nílò API key."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The service is running."
msgstr "Iṣẹ́ náà ń ṣiṣẹ́."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`status`"
msgstr "`status`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Always ok when the service is running."
msgstr "Ó máa ń jẹ́ `ok` nígbà tí iṣẹ́ náà bá ń ṣiṣẹ́."